# Shared ignore file for BOTH the release image (Dockerfile) and the test
# image (Dockerfile.test). Per-Dockerfile ignore files (Dockerfile.testignore)
# did not take effect on this toolchain, so this one file must satisfy both:
# - tests/ and scripts/ are KEPT: the test image needs them (pytest + ruff
#   lint). They are harmless in the release context — the release Dockerfile
#   only COPYs src/ — so the context just carries ~1 MB extra.
# - data/ and models/ are excluded for both: the release image fetches the
#   model from Hugging Face at build time and the tests use a fake adapter.
.git
.venv
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
.pipeline
data/
models/
reports/
docs/
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.test
.dockerignore
HANDOFF.md
